title: "Directional accuracy under three definitions: code and results for a Bitcoin application"
abstract: "Code and result tables for the manuscript 'Directional Accuracy Is Three Different Measures: Closed Forms, No-Skill Reference Values and a Bitcoin Application'. The notebook compares nine one-day-ahead forecasts of the Bitcoin daily close over 1 January 2024 to 11 November 2026, computes directional accuracy in three ways, and runs the Monte Carlo experiments, the positive control and the calibrated tests of the manuscript. The price data are not redistributed; the scripts rebuild them from the provider's exports."
